  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "In this game, you are robot (#). Your job is to find a kitten hiding from Sirhan. This task is complicated by the existence of various things which are not kitten. Robot must touch items to determine if they are kitten or not. The game ends when robotfindskitten.\r\n\r\nUse the Control Pad on controller 1 or controller 2 to move robot. Bump into an object to see if it is kitten. If it is, you win! If not, the description of a non-kitten item (NKI) will appear on your side of the status."
    }
  ],
